{"id":"b8166abeed6d1166","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/164_Buss_有界算术_T^i_2.md","title":"164 Buss 有界算术 T^i 2","display":"164_Buss_有界算术_T^i_2","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"164.-Buss-有界算术-$T^i_2$\">164. Buss 有界算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^i_2\">\\(T^i_2\\)</span></h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-参数与符号\">1. 参数与符号</h1>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge1\">\\(i\\ge1\\)</span>。变量集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=x_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{n:x_n\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=x_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{n:x_n\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>参数合法性谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow i\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ge1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow i\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ge1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>函数构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times,|-|,\\lfloor-/2\\rfloor,\\#\">\\(0,S,+,\\times,|-|,\\lfloor-/2\\rfloor,\\#\\)</span>，关系构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，等号构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span>，逻辑构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\">\\(\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le y:=(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y)\">\\(x\\le y:=(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y)\\)</span>。本系统的目标公理族是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_i\">\\(\\Sigma^b_i\\)</span> 后继归纳。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式和层级\">2. 项、公式和层级</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t),|t|,\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(S(t),|t|,\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t,s\\times t,s\\#t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(s+t,s\\times t,s\\#t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\">\\(s&lt;t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有界量词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\le tA:=\\forall x(x\\le t\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x\\le tA:=\\forall x(x\\le t\\to A)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\le tA:=\\neg\\forall x\\le t\\neg A\">\\(\\exists x\\le tA:=\\neg\\forall x\\le t\\neg A\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\\land\n\\exists u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\,(t=|u|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\\land\n\\exists u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\,(t=|u|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\Delta^b_0\\)</span> 是满足下列五条的最小公式类：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\bot\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t,s&lt;t\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(s\\doteq t,s&lt;t\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span> 蕴含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{SharpOK}_{T^i_2}(x,t)\\)</span>\n蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\le tA\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\forall x\\le tA\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>在第 4 条相同的 sharply bounded 条件下，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\le tA\\in\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\exists x\\le tA\\in\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_0=\\Pi^b_0=\\Delta^b_0\">\\(\\Sigma^b_0=\\Pi^b_0=\\Delta^b_0\\)</span>，并递归定义量词块</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExBlk}_0(A)=\\operatorname{AllBlk}_0(A)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExBlk}_0(A)=\\operatorname{AllBlk}_0(A)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\exists x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\exists x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{ExBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\forall x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m+1}(\\vec x,\\vec t;A)\n=\\forall x_m\\le t_m\\,\n\\operatorname{AllBlk}_{m}(\\vec x{\\upharpoonright}m,\n\\vec t{\\upharpoonright}m;A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\vec x:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t:m\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\vec t:m\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;m\">\\(j&lt;m\\)</span> 成立。\n固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 后的层级表为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\nk&amp;\\Sigma^b_k&amp;\\Pi^b_k\\\\ \\hline\n0&amp;\\Delta^b_0&amp;\\Delta^b_0\\\\\nk+1&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{ExBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A):m\\in\\mathbb N,\nA\\in\\Pi^b_k,\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\\}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{AllBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A):m\\in\\mathbb N,\nA\\in\\Sigma^b_k,\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\\}\n\\end{array}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\nk&amp;\\Sigma^b_k&amp;\\Pi^b_k\\\\ \\hline\n0&amp;\\Delta^b_0&amp;\\Delta^b_0\\\\\nk+1&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{ExBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A):m\\in\\mathbb N,\nA\\in\\Pi^b_k,\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\\}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{AllBlk}_m(\\vec x,\\vec t;A):m\\in\\mathbb N,\nA\\in\\Sigma^b_k,\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\operatorname{BoundOK}_{T^i_2}(x_j,t_j)\\}\n\\end{array}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2}(A,k,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\land k\\le i\n\\land\\bigl((k=0\\land A\\in\\Delta^b_0)\\lor\n(0&lt;k\\land(A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\lor A\\in\\Pi^b_k))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2}(A,k,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\land k\\le i\n\\land\\bigl((k=0\\land A\\in\\Delta^b_0)\\lor\n(0&lt;k\\land(A\\in\\Sigma^b_k\\lor A\\in\\Pi^b_k))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma^b_i\">\\(A\\in\\Sigma^b_i\\)</span> 可由有限层级表独立检查；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 的空块显式给出相邻层包含关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV_T}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(|t|)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(|t|)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(\\lfloor t/2\\rfloor)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\#t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\#t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV_F}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{T^i_2}:\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{T^i_2}:\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[x:=t]\">\\(r[x:=t]\\)</span>。其子句为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x[x:=t]=t\">\\(x[x:=t]=t\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=y\">\\(y[x:=t]=y\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0[x:=t]=0\">\\(0[x:=t]=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(r)[x:=t]=S(r[x:=t])\">\\(S(r)[x:=t]=S(r[x:=t])\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|r|[x:=t]=|r[x:=t]|\">\\(|r|[x:=t]=|r[x:=t]|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor r/2\\rfloor[x:=t]=\\lfloor r[x:=t]/2\\rfloor\">\\(\\lfloor r/2\\rfloor[x:=t]=\\lfloor r[x:=t]/2\\rfloor\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(r_0+r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]+r_1[x:=t]\">\\((r_0+r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]+r_1[x:=t]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(r_0\\times r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]\\times r_1[x:=t]\">\\((r_0\\times r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]\\times r_1[x:=t]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(r_0\\# r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]\\# r_1[x:=t]\">\\((r_0\\# r_1)[x:=t]=r_0[x:=t]\\# r_1[x:=t]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义公式替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{T^i_2}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{T^i_2}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=t]\">\\(A[x:=t]\\)</span>。原子子句为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s\\doteq u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\doteq u[x:=t])\">\\((s\\doteq u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\doteq u[x:=t])\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s&lt;u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]&lt;u[x:=t])\">\\((s&lt;u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]&lt;u[x:=t])\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot\">\\(\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot\\)</span>；三个二元联结词逐分量替换。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\forall yB\">\\(A=\\forall yB\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yB, &amp; y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(B[x:=t]), &amp; y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((B[y:=z])[x:=t]), &amp; y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yB, &amp; y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(B[x:=t]), &amp; y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((B[y:=z])[x:=t]), &amp; y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV_F}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV_F}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 在替换式中作为变量项使用。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\bot)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\bot)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV_F}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV_F}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV_F}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV_F}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV_F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是公式集上的等价关系，\n对全部公式构造子的各参数相容，并包含所有满足该新鲜条件的绑定改名对。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\to(A,B)\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E(\\operatorname{AlphaComp}(E)\\to(A,B)\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-基础公理\">4. 基础公理</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}=\\{\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\quad\n(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\quad\n((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}=\\{\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\quad\n(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\quad\n((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]\">\\(\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV_F}(A)\\)</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\">\\(\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq t\">\\(t\\doteq t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\\to(C[s/z]\\to C[t/z])\">\\(s\\doteq t\\to(C[s/z]\\to C[t/z])\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 由下列公式模式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 的全部变量实例组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\quad S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\quad\nx+0\\doteq x,\\quad x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\quad S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\quad\nx+0\\doteq x,\\quad x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\times0\\doteq0,\\quad x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\quad\n|0|\\doteq0,\\quad |S(x)|\\le S(|x|),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\times0\\doteq0,\\quad x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\quad\n|0|\\doteq0,\\quad |S(x)|\\le S(|x|),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor0/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(S(x))/2\\rfloor\\doteq S(\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor),\\quad\n|x\\#y|\\doteq S(|x|\\times|y|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lfloor0/2\\rfloor\\doteq0,\\quad\n\\lfloor S(S(x))/2\\rfloor\\doteq S(\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor),\\quad\n|x\\#y|\\doteq S(|x|\\times|y|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-$\\Sigma^b_i$-后继归纳\">5. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_i\">\\(\\Sigma^b_i\\)</span> 后继归纳</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^i_2\">\\(T^i_2\\)</span> 的目标公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}(A,x,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\land\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2}(A,i,i)\n\\land A\\in\\Sigma^b_i\n\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{BV_F}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}(A,x,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2}(i)\n\\land\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2}(A,i,i)\n\\land A\\in\\Sigma^b_i\n\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{BV_F}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}\\)</span> 同时检查参数、目标层、归纳变量排序与绑定新鲜性。其生成式唯一是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A[x:=0]\\to\n\\bigl((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A[x:=0]\\to\n\\bigl((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中后继步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to A[x:=S(x)]\">\\(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]\\)</span> 不调用多项式归纳的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A\">\\(A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^i_2\">\\(S^i_2\\)</span> 的多项式归纳不同，本系统不使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A\">\\(A[x:=\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor]\\to A\\)</span> 作为步进条件；其步进条件固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to A[x:=S(x)]\">\\(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_i\\operatorname{-IND}}=\n\\{\\,A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA)\\mid\n\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}(A,x,i)\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_i\\operatorname{-IND}}=\n\\{\\,A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA)\\mid\n\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2}(A,x,i)\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_i\\operatorname{-IND}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CL}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall=}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Sigma^b_i\\operatorname{-IND}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{\\,((A),\\forall xA)\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{\\,((A),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{\\,((A),\\forall xA)\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{\\,((A),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;m\">\\(j&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2}\">\\(A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV_F}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV_F}(G)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{T^i_2}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{T^i_2}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-形式系统\">9. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{T^i_2}=(i,\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},\\Delta^b_0,(\\Sigma^b_k)_{k\\le i},(\\Pi^b_k)_{k\\le i},\\operatorname{ExBlk},\\operatorname{AllBlk},\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2},\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2},\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FV_F},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{T^i_2},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{T^i_2},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2},\\vdash_{T^i_2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{T^i_2}=(i,\\operatorname{ParamOK}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\\mathsf{Term}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{T^i_2},\\Delta^b_0,(\\Sigma^b_k)_{k\\le i},(\\Pi^b_k)_{k\\le i},\\operatorname{ExBlk},\\operatorname{AllBlk},\\operatorname{LevelOK}_{T^i_2},\\operatorname{INDInst}_{T^i_2},\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FV_F},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{T^i_2},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{T^i_2},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{T^i_2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{T^i_2},